{
  "purpose": "Check the direct approach from fully relaxed wings, grip at both feet, and the emitted entrance terraces on the shared full-Pisco and three-coupon Mark2 plate.",
  "archive_sha256": "569801665428d8c132e64530a150ff9fecb45f06e960a3b8d7c2a571558d000f",
